### Topic 63 - OpenFeign sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension: click "Send Request")
### Start product-service (8081) first, then order-service (8082).

@product = http://localhost:8081
@order = http://localhost:8082

### 1. product-service directly - all products
GET {{product}}/api/products

### 2. product-service directly - one product
GET {{product}}/api/products/1

### 3. order-service -> Feign -> product-service : product list
GET {{order}}/api/orders/products

### 4. Place an order (happy path) -> 201 Created
POST {{order}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### 5. Product does not exist -> product-service 404 -> ErrorDecoder -> 404 ProblemDetail
POST {{order}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 99, "quantity": 1 }

### 6. Out of stock (product 3 has stock 0) -> 409
POST {{order}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 3, "quantity": 1 }

### 7. Validation error (quantity 0) -> 400, product-service is never called
POST {{order}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 0 }

### 8. All orders placed so far
GET {{order}}/api/orders

### 9. Timeout demo: product-service waits 3 s, Feign read-timeout is 2 s -> 504
GET {{order}}/api/orders/timeout-demo?productId=1&delayMs=3000

### 10. Same call but fast enough (1 s) -> 200
GET {{order}}/api/orders/timeout-demo?productId=1&delayMs=1000
